{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新皇崗口岸早上正式開通，不少市民和旅客試用新口岸過關，本台實測大約一分鐘內，經自助通道 「三道閘門」完成來往兩地通關手續。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有市民認為通關過程快捷方便，亦有使用口岸的跨境車司機表示，車道查驗過程大致順暢。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T16:39:22.644324+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:50:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T19:38:16.739515+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T16:38:13.449933+00:00","content_hash":"f74e1380cb8c298219ee11fed394e6622977e4329e85d9cb492fadb5e10883f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}